@startuml "Gestion des erreurs et monitoring"

title Gestion des erreurs et monitoring système

participant "Business Services" as Services
participant "Message Queue\n(Bull/Redis)" as Queue
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Cache Layer\n(Redis)" as Cache
participant "Monitoring\n(Prometheus)" as Monitoring
participant "Logging\n(Winston)" as Logging
participant "Email Service\n(SMTP)" as Email

Services -> Services: Error occurs
Services -> Logging: Log error details
Services -> Monitoring: Increment error counter
Services -> Queue: addJob('retry_failed_operation', {data}, {delay: 30s})

Monitoring -> Monitoring: Check system health
Monitoring -> DB: Check connection pool
Monitoring -> Cache: Check Redis availability
Monitoring -> Queue: Check job queue health

alt System unhealthy
    Monitoring -> Monitoring: Trigger alerts
    Monitoring -> Email: Send alert to admins
end

@enduml